  "body": "Writing `a * b * c` in a post renders as \u003ccode\u003ea \u003cem\u003e b \u003c/em\u003e c\u003c/code\u003e, so the stars vanish from the code. The same thing happens to underscores in link URLs: [notes](https://example.org/my_page_name) produces an href with \u003cem\u003e tags in it. Code spans and link targets should be left alone by the emphasis rules.",
