  "state": "open",
  "comments": [
    {
      "body": "Fixed in quillmark/markdown.py: inline() now swaps code spans and link opening tags (with their href) for placeholders before the strong/emphasis rules run, then restores them. Stars and underscores inside `code` and in link URLs are left untouched; link text and surrounding text are still formatted. Added regression tests in tests/test_markdown.py (code span with *, code span with _, URL with underscores, emphasis in link text, emphasis around code spans). Full pytest suite passes (43 passed)."
    }
  ]
}

